x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Seized_by_Planar_Binding_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Seized_by_Planar_Binding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Seized by Planar Binding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Seized_by_Planar_Binding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Seized_by_Planar_Binding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Seized_by_Planar_Binding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Seized_by_Planar_Binding_(Condition)\" title=\"Seized by Planar Binding (Condition)\">Seized by Planar Binding</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Turned_(Condition)\" title=\"Turned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Turned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Turned_(Condition)\" title=\"Turned (Condition)\">Turned</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Conditions in the status group <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(status_group)\" title=\"Frightened (status group)\">Frightened</a></span> are <i>not</i> affected, and the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fearful_(Condition)\" title=\"Fearful (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fearful\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fearful_(Condition)\" title=\"Fearful (Condition)\">Fearful</a> condition can produce effects similar to incapacitation</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Only affected by 1 turn by any controlling and incapacitating effect.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202249\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.083 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.092 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3144/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29884/4194304 byt